# The leaves-the-battlefield ability belongs to the Vestige's controller as it left (CR 603.2, 603.10a, 608.2), not its owner. Bot1 hard-casts
# the Vestige on turn 1 (Black Lotus and three Moxen). On turn 2 Bot2 steals it with Act of Treason and exiles it with Swords to
# Plowshares: Bot2 draws a card and puts a permanent card from Bot2's own hand (Mox Emerald, mana value 0 <= 0 lands) onto its battlefield
# tapped; Bot1, the owner, draws nothing and its hand is unchanged. Bot2 gains 7 life from the Swords (the Vestige's power).

